<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Certko Backlink Kit — Free Embed Badges &amp; BIS Widget</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free Certko embed badges and BIS product-check widget for manufacturer sites, blogs and partner pages. Branded attribution to certko.com — useful, optional, removable." />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="<%= baseUrl %>/backlink-kit" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/certko-favicon.png" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Certko Backlink Kit — Embed Badges & BIS Widget" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Copy-paste Certko badges and a free BIS checker widget that links back to certko.com." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="<%= baseUrl %>/backlink-kit" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@600;700;800&family=Figtree:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #16263d;
      --muted: #4b5563;
      --cream: #faf6ee;
      --butter: #f7c453;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --line: rgba(22, 38, 61, 0.12);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Figtree, sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 0%, rgba(247, 196, 83, 0.2), transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 10%, rgba(28, 48, 76, 0.1), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cream), #f3eee3);
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      background: rgba(250, 246, 238, 0.92);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: 20;
    }
    .top img { height: 40px; width: auto; }
    .top a.cta {
      text-decoration: none;
      background: var(--butter);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
    }
    .hero {
      width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem;
      animation: rise 700ms ease both;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
      max-width: 12ch;
    }
    .hero p {
      max-width: 48ch;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      font: inherit;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--butter); color: var(--ink); }
    .btn-ghost { background: #fff; border-color: var(--line); }
    section {
      width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
      animation: rise 700ms ease both;
    }
    h2 {
      font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    }
    .lead { color: var(--muted); max-width: 55ch; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; line-height: 1.55; }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .panel {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 0.9rem;
      padding: 1.1rem;
    }
    .panel.dark { background: var(--ink); color: #faf6ee; }
    .preview {
      min-height: 4.5rem;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
      background: #f3eee3;
    }
    .panel.dark .preview { background: #121a2b; }
    .panel h3 {
      font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    }
    .panel p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .panel.dark p { color: #c5ccd6; }
    pre {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
      background: #121a2b;
      color: #f3eee3;
      overflow: auto;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
    .copy {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--butter);
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 0.55rem;
      padding: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .copied { background: #1c304c !important; color: #faf6ee !important; }
    .rules {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    li + li { margin-top: 0.4rem; }
    .widget-demo {
      border: 0;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      height: 290px;
      border-radius: 0.9rem;
      background: transparent;
    }
    .assets a {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.9rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .assets a span { display: block; font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.2rem; }
    .outreach {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .outreach details {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    }
    .outreach summary {
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .outreach pre { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
    footer {
      width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    footer a { font-weight: 700; }
    @keyframes rise {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .grid, .rules { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero h1 { max-width: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="top">
    <a href="https://certko.com/" aria-label="Certko home">
      <img src="/assets/certko-logo.png" alt="Certko — Compliance. Assured." width="150" height="42" />
    </a>
    <a class="cta" href="https://certko.com/contact?utm_source=backlink_kit&utm_medium=referral">Get expert help</a>
  </div>

  <header class="hero">
    <h1>Certko</h1>
    <p>Free embed badges and a BIS product-check widget partners can place on their sites. Useful for visitors, optional to remove, and attributed with branded “Certko” links back to certko.com.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#badges">Copy a badge</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#widget">Embed the widget</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#assets">Linkable assets</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="badges">
    <h2>Embed badges</h2>
    <p class="lead">One-line HTML. Links use branded anchor text (Certko) — not keyword-stuffed phrases. Hosts can delete the snippet anytime.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="preview"><img src="/embed/badge-light.svg" alt="Certko light badge" width="200" height="48" /></div>
        <h3>Light</h3>
        <p>Best on cream or white pages.</p>
        <pre id="snip-light">&lt;a href="https://certko.com/?utm_source=embed&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=backlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Certko"&gt;
  &lt;img src="<%= baseUrl %>/embed/badge-light.svg" alt="Certko" width="200" height="48" loading="lazy" /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;</pre>
        <button class="copy" data-target="snip-light" type="button">Copy HTML</button>
      </div>
      <div class="panel dark">
        <div class="preview"><img src="/embed/badge-dark.svg" alt="Certko dark badge" width="200" height="48" /></div>
        <h3>Dark</h3>
        <p>Best on navy or charcoal footers.</p>
        <pre id="snip-dark">&lt;a href="https://certko.com/?utm_source=embed&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=backlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Certko"&gt;
  &lt;img src="<%= baseUrl %>/embed/badge-dark.svg" alt="Certko" width="200" height="48" loading="lazy" /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;</pre>
        <button class="copy" data-target="snip-dark" type="button">Copy HTML</button>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="preview" style="background:#16263d"><img src="/embed/badge-compact.svg" alt="Powered by Certko" width="148" height="36" /></div>
        <h3>Compact</h3>
        <p>Small “Powered by Certko” mark.</p>
        <pre id="snip-compact">&lt;a href="https://certko.com/?utm_source=embed&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=backlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Certko"&gt;
  &lt;img src="<%= baseUrl %>/embed/badge-compact.svg" alt="Powered by Certko" width="148" height="36" loading="lazy" /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;</pre>
        <button class="copy" data-target="snip-compact" type="button">Copy HTML</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="panel" style="margin-top:1rem">
      <h3>Script embed (optional)</h3>
      <p>Paste before <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code>. Change <code>data-theme</code> to <code>light</code>, <code>dark</code>, or <code>compact</code>.</p>
      <pre id="snip-js">&lt;script src="<%= baseUrl %>/embed/certko-badge.js" data-theme="light" data-base="<%= baseUrl %>" async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</pre>
      <button class="copy" data-target="snip-js" type="button">Copy script</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="widget">
    <h2>BIS checker widget</h2>
    <p class="lead">A small iframe your visitors can use to search Certko. Attribution is branded “Certko” only. Remove the iframe whenever you want.</p>
    <div class="rules">
      <div class="panel">
        <iframe class="widget-demo" title="Certko BIS checker widget" src="/embed/widget" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Iframe snippet</h3>
        <pre id="snip-widget">&lt;iframe
  src="<%= baseUrl %>/embed/widget"
  title="Certko BIS checker"
  loading="lazy"
  style="width:100%;max-width:420px;height:290px;border:0;border-radius:12px;"
&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;</pre>
        <button class="copy" data-target="snip-widget" type="button">Copy iframe</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="rules">
    <h2>Safe link guidelines</h2>
    <div class="rules">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Do</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Use branded anchors: <strong>Certko</strong> or <strong>Powered by Certko</strong></li>
          <li>Place badges where they help users (footer, resources, blog tools)</li>
          <li>Keep the embed optional and removable</li>
          <li>Point traffic to <a href="https://certko.com/">certko.com</a> with UTM <code>utm_source=embed</code></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Don’t</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Don’t force keyword anchors like “BIS certification India”</li>
          <li>Don’t inject sitewide links without the host’s consent</li>
          <li>Don’t hide the badge or cloak the destination</li>
          <li>Don’t sell or automate paid link schemes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="assets">
    <h2>Linkable assets</h2>
    <p class="lead">Citeable pages worth linking from blogs, directories and partner sites — each points readers deeper into Certko.</p>
    <div class="panel assets">
      <a href="/resources-bis-statistics">BIS certification statistics<span>1,400+ products · 400+ labs · scheme split — citeable snapshot</span></a>
      <a href="/resources-qco-deadlines">Upcoming QCO deadlines<span>Next enforcement dates manufacturers watch</span></a>
      <a href="/bis-certification">BIS certification lander<span>ISI / CRS / FMCS process, costs and quote form</span></a>
      <a href="https://certko.com/guide?utm_source=backlink_kit&utm_medium=referral">Complete BIS guide on certko.com<span>Long-form process, documents and cost ranges</span></a>
      <a href="https://certko.com/qco?utm_source=backlink_kit&utm_medium=referral">Live QCO tracker on certko.com<span>Mandatory / upcoming Quality Control Orders</span></a>
      <a href="https://certko.com/labs?utm_source=backlink_kit&utm_medium=referral">BIS-recognised labs directory<span>Search labs by scope and location</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="outreach">
    <h2>Partner outreach templates</h2>
    <p class="lead">Short emails you can send to manufacturers, labs, consultants and trade publishers.</p>
    <div class="outreach">
      <details open>
        <summary>Manufacturer / exporter site</summary>
        <pre id="mail-mfg">Subject: Free BIS checker widget for your site

Hi {{name}},

We built a small free widget that lets visitors check whether a product needs BIS certification (search → Certko database).

If useful for your customers, you can paste this iframe on a resources or FAQ page:

&lt;iframe src="<%= baseUrl %>/embed/widget" title="Certko BIS checker" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:420px;height:290px;border:0;"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;

It’s optional and removable anytime. Happy to help if you want a lighter badge instead.

— Certko team
info@certko.com</pre>
        <button class="copy" data-target="mail-mfg" type="button">Copy email</button>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Lab or consultant partner</summary>
        <pre id="mail-lab">Subject: Add a Certko badge to your resources page?

Hi {{name}},

Certko publishes free BIS product, lab and QCO data used by importers and manufacturers.

If you’d like a simple “Powered by Certko” badge linking to our checker for your clients, here’s a compact snippet:

&lt;a href="https://certko.com/?utm_source=embed&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=partner" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;
  &lt;img src="<%= baseUrl %>/embed/badge-compact.svg" alt="Powered by Certko" width="148" height="36" /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;

Full kit: <%= baseUrl %>/backlink-kit

Thanks,
Certko</pre>
        <button class="copy" data-target="mail-lab" type="button">Copy email</button>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Trade blog / journalist</summary>
        <pre id="mail-press">Subject: Citeable BIS / QCO stats for your readers

Hi {{name}},

If helpful for an upcoming compliance piece, Certko maintains:

• Product ↔ IS standard mapping (1,400+)
• Reported lab test price ranges
• Upcoming QCO enforcement dates

Snapshot page: <%= baseUrl %>/resources-bis-statistics
Live QCO tracker: https://certko.com/qco

Happy to fact-check figures or share a quote.

— Certko | info@certko.com</pre>
        <button class="copy" data-target="mail-press" type="button">Copy email</button>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p><strong>Certko</strong> · <a href="mailto:info@certko.com">info@certko.com</a> · <a href="tel:+919999118039">+91 9999118039</a></p>
    <p>Embeds exist to help visitors check compliance — not as a paid link scheme. Attribution stays branded.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll(".copy").forEach(function (button) {
      button.addEventListener("click", async function () {
        var target = document.getElementById(button.getAttribute("data-target"));
        if (!target) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(target.textContent);
          button.classList.add("copied");
          button.textContent = "Copied";
          setTimeout(function () {
            button.classList.remove("copied");
            button.textContent = button.textContent.indexOf("email") >= 0 ? "Copy email" : button.getAttribute("data-target") === "snip-js" ? "Copy script" : button.getAttribute("data-target") === "snip-widget" ? "Copy iframe" : "Copy HTML";
            if (button.getAttribute("data-target").indexOf("mail-") === 0) button.textContent = "Copy email";
          }, 1600);
        } catch (error) {
          alert("Copy failed — select the snippet manually.");
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
